egin{aligned}(-1)^{2}+(-1)+1 & =A(-1)^{2}(-1+1)+B(-1)(-1+1)+C(-1+1)+D(-1)^{3} \\\\ 1-1+1 & =-D \\\\ 1 & =-D \\\\ D & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{2}+0+1 & =A(0)^{2}(0+1)+B(0)(0+1)+C(0+1)+D(0)^{3} \\\\ 1 & =C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=1$ and using our values for $C$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{1}^{2}+1+1 & =A(1)^{2}(1+1)+B(1)(1+1)+1(1+1)+(-1)(1)^{3} \\\\ 1+1+1 & =2A+2B+2-1 \\\\ 2B & =2-2A \\\\ B & =1-A.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=2$ and using our values for $C$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{2}+2+1 & =A(2)^{2}(2+1)+B(2)(2+1)+1(2+1)+(-1)(2)^{3} \\\\ 4+2+1 & =12A+6B+3-8 \\\\ 6B & =12-12A \\\\ B & =2-2A.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-A & =2-2A \\\\ A & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $A$ into $(1)$  to get the value of $B:$\n\n$$\nB=1-1=0\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nAB-CD=1(0)-1(-1)=1.\n$$" 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345899 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345900 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345901 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345902 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345903 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1041 "selection" 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1104 #edb/ref 17592186345899 13194139535362 true] [17592186345898 1110 #uuid "2328cd00-6281-5b62-8c32-00dbf60032f8" 13194139535362 true] [17592186345899 1034 "1" 13194139535362 true] [17592186345899 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535362 true] [17592186345899 1111 #uuid "cf6fd773-17da-5617-b5b6-9b1a1f9ac508" 13194139535362 true] [17592186345900 1034 "-3" 13194139535362 true] [17592186345900 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535362 true] [17592186345900 1111 #uuid "ebe63480-3758-55f1-b6cd-8f28527c0a27" 13194139535362 true] [1759218634590